              appearing in this sequence of isomorphisms is that of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cellular+cohomology"} cellular cochains
              (
              %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+I#CellularChainComplex"}> def.
