                      %mi d
                      %mn 1
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} d_1
              coincides with the differential in the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cellular+cochain+complex"} cellular cochain complex
              (
              %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+I#CellularChainComplex"}> def.
              ).
            %p
              We discuss this now for
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
